Z||000000||swoods||09-04-2001||12:07 AM||||Alright I think I need some more advice before I buy this new motor. The motor Im thinking about buying is a 91 2.8 out of a chevy s-10 I know were going to have to remount the starter but this motor is going to cost me $700 dollars this motor has been totally rebuilt .30 over, it as trw pistons rings, new bearings, new GM crank, high volume oil pump I mean this think has everything new in it the motor itself has less than 5000 miles on it.He told me he has more than $1450 in this motor. My main concern is is it worth the price and how much more horespower over stock do you think Ill get.I hope everyone will give me some good advice.||||reg||14
