Z||000002||GT Bastard||09-04-2001||02:08 PM||||More than likely, it won't make ANY more hp than stock...  To say it has TRW pistons doesn't really mean much.  If they're higher compression pistons then yeah, you'll get a little gain.  You'd better find out what cam it has though.  Was he running the factory TBI setup, or did he carb it?  If it's carbed, chances are that cam won't be computer friendly.  Personally, I'm a big fan of choosing and installing the parts myself.  That is, unless you know this guy really well....  Good luck<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtbastard.gif">     <P>"My heroes are John Wayne, the Simpsons, and whoever canceled Full House/Bob Saget."||||reg||1
